      "transformProfile": "command-override",
      "reason": "Closure fix. Repo commands/grill-with-docs.md delegates to a native skill(name: \"grill-with-docs\"), but grill-with-docs is NOT a managed skill dir — it only exists in a user's config if installed from an unrelated source. This override loads the bundled skill via MCP so /grill-with-docs works on any machine running the flywheel MCP server."
